## Tips {% #tips %}

{% aside type="tip" id="armourer-coin-floor" %}
Set **Keep at least this many coins** before you turn the module on. Then a big order can never empty your coins.
{% /aside %}

- [Towers](/modules/towers/), [Storms](/modules/storms/) and [Khan](/modules/khan/) can also buy tools from the armourer for their own castles. They buy on their own, apart from this module and its limits.
- To build tools in your workshops instead of buying them, see [Refinery and toolsmith](/modules/refinery-toolsmith/).

## Related errors {% #errors %}

- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ROW](/errors/#plugin-option-row): a row of **Stock targets** is not complete.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_CASTLE](/errors/#plugin-option-castle): a row names a castle the account no longer has.
